                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's alright for a free game.\n\nPros:\n\n- Cute enemies\n- Nice artstyle and good looking levels\n- Ability to use your towers more effectively in first-person mode every now and then\n\nCons:\n\n- Squads and buildings can get easily killed even though they cost a lot unless you build very effectively\n- Lack of sound effects\n- Lack of different towers\n- Bad aim with some towers in first-person mode\n- Power-ups cost a lot, though I guess the idea here is to sacrifice 1/5 of your money for a powerup instead of losing one tower that could cost you everything.\n\nI recommend trying it out.\n",
